    {
      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>33</mn></math></p>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given: Carrier Swing <math><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math><br /><br />From the defining equation,<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />First determining <math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math> ,<br /><br /><math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math><br /><br />Now substituting into the equation for <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>6.25</mn></math>"
  }
